{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"time-duration-calculator UI copy.method.paragraphs.2","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"time-duration-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.2","keys":["time-duration-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.2"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Un canvi de rellotge de primavera pot eliminar una hora del rellotge local. Algunes hores locals mai ocorren. Un canvi de tardor pot repetir una hora, fent una etiqueta ambigua. Aquesta calculadora rebutja les hores que falten i pregunta quina ocurrència voleu dir per a les hores repetides. Mai mou silenciosament la vostra entrada.","record_id":"ce2d8be1c023089698c525fb554722e7a14172a0578ed6e94c8a17b69610a2de","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":0.9769227214999887,"source":"A spring clock change can remove an hour from the local clock. Some local times never occur. An autumn change can repeat an hour, making a label ambiguous. This calculator rejects missing times and asks which occurrence you mean for repeated times. It never silently moves your input.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"0cb1ecf008172991fb74da08089f6548a60e70ea08c93132d80893fdbab50184","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Un canvi de rellotge de primavera pot eliminar una hora del rellotge local. Algunes hores locals mai ocorren. Un canvi de tardor pot repetir una hora, fent una etiqueta ambigua. Aquesta calculadora rebutja les hores que falten i pregunta quina ocurrència voleu dir per a les hores repetides. Mai mou silenciosament la vostra entrada.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
